---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import MarketTemperature from '../components/MarketTemperature.astro';
import ColorBar from '../components/ColorBar.astro';
---
<Layout title="Market Data for Franklin, Brentwood, Spring Hill and Middle TN" description="Market temperature and housing data for Franklin, Brentwood, Spring Hill, Thompson's Station and Nolensville, with sources and as-of dates.">
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Market data" title="How's the market <em>moving?</em>" lead="Market temperature by city, based on months of supply, with the sources and date shown for every number." />
  <section class="s band"><div class="wrap two wl">
    <MarketTemperature />
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">How to read the gauge</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Seller's market:</b> under 4 months of supply. Homes tend to sell quickly.</li>
        <li><b>Balanced market:</b> 4 to 6 months of supply.</li>
        <li><b>Buyer's market:</b> over 6 months of supply. Buyers typically have more choices and negotiating room.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Months of supply is how long it would take to sell every active listing at the current pace of sales. Conditions vary by neighborhood and price range, so ask me how your area compares.</p>
      <p class="hint">Charts for median price, days on market, inventory and the 30-year mortgage rate are added as the monthly data feed goes live. Every figure will show its source and "as of" date.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
